SUMMARY:What is a Thanksgiving\, or any big family meal\, from years ago th
 at you can still picture? Where was it?
DESCRIPTION:Day 1 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What is a Th
 anksgiving\, or any big family meal\, from years ago that you can still pi
 cture? Where was it?\n\nThen: Who was at the table\, and who did the cooki
 ng?\n\nTip: Today everyone who remembers may be in the same room. Ask whil
 e the plates are mostly empty and nobody has stood up yet.\n\nAll thirty q
 uestions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n
 \nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
