SUMMARY:Who hosted the big holiday meals when you were young\, and what was
  their kitchen like?
DESCRIPTION:Day 2 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Who hosted t
 he big holiday meals when you were young\, and what was their kitchen like
 ?\n\nThen: What job were you given once you were old enough to help?\n\nTi
 p: Leftovers day. Ask over a plate of them. It is the easiest setting ther
 e is.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/
 print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe 
 from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
