DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261128
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261129
SUMMARY:What dish showed up every year\, made the same way every time? Who 
 made it?
DESCRIPTION:Day 3 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What dish sh
 owed up every year\, made the same way every time? Who made it?\n\nThen: W
 here is that recipe now: on a card\, in a book\, or only in someone's head
 ?\n\nTip: If the recipe lives only in their head\, offer to cook it with t
 hem this month and write it down as you go.\n\nAll thirty questions\, prin
 table: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome
 . No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
