BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: What dish showed up every year\, made the sam
 e way every time? Who made it?
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-holidays-20261126-d04-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261129
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:What holidays did the household you grew up in celebrate? Walk me t
 hrough one of those days from the morning on.
DESCRIPTION:Day 4 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What holiday
 s did the household you grew up in celebrate? Walk me through one of those
  days from the morning on.\n\nThen: What was the one rule everyone had to 
 follow that day?\n\nTip: Do not assume you know the traditions. Ask\, even
  if you think you know.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://quest
 ion-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothi
 ng to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
