CLASS:PUBLIC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: What holidays did the household you grew up i
 n celebrate? Walk me through one of those days from the morning on.
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:puretome-question-a-day-holidays-20261126-d05-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261130
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261201
SUMMARY:What is the first winter you remember clearly? Where were you livin
 g?
DESCRIPTION:Day 5 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What is the 
 first winter you remember clearly? Where were you living?\n\nThen: How did
  you keep warm\, and what did you wear outside?\n\nTip: Weather is an easy
  way into a memory. Cold rooms and snowed-in days come back fast.\n\nAll t
 hirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays
 .html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
CLASS:PUBLIC
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Today's question: What is the first winter you remember clearly
 ? Where were you living?
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT9H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
