UID:puretome-question-a-day-holidays-20261126-d06-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261202
SUMMARY:Tell me about a gift you gave someone that you are still pleased ab
 out.
DESCRIPTION:Day 6 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Tell me abou
 t a gift you gave someone that you are still pleased about.\n\nThen: How d
 id you pay for it\, or how did you make it?\n\nTip: Asking about a gift th
 ey gave\, not one they got\, takes them somewhere less expected.\n\nAll th
 irty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.
 html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
