DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261202
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261203
SUMMARY:What is a gift you were given as a child that you remember\, even a
  small one? Who gave it to you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 7 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What is a gi
 ft you were given as a child that you remember\, even a small one? Who gav
 e it to you?\n\nThen: Where did you keep it?\n\nTip: Gifts were scarce in 
 some homes. If that was true for them\, ask what the day felt like instead
 .\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/prin
 t/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from
 .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
