SUMMARY:What did the house look like at the holidays when you were growing 
 up? Who did the decorating\, if anyone?
DESCRIPTION:Day 8 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What did the
  house look like at the holidays when you were growing up? Who did the dec
 orating\, if anyone?\n\nThen: What happened to those things?\n\nTip: If an
 ything survived\, an ornament\, a candle holder\, a tablecloth\, ask them 
 to bring it out.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-d
 ay.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to u
 nsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
