DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261204
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261205
SUMMARY:Tell me about a holiday that went wrong. What happened?
DESCRIPTION:Day 9 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Tell me abou
 t a holiday that went wrong. What happened?\n\nThen: Who still brings it u
 p?\n\nTip: Disasters make the best holiday stories\, and most of them are 
 safe to laugh about now.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://ques
 tion-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, noth
 ing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
