DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261206
SUMMARY:Where did people gather around the holidays when you were young: a 
 church\, a temple\, a hall\, a neighbor's house? Describe walking in.
DESCRIPTION:Day 10 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Where did p
 eople gather around the holidays when you were young: a church\, a temple\
 , a hall\, a neighbor's house? Describe walking in.\n\nThen: Who did you a
 lways see there?\n\nTip: If the answer is nowhere\, ask where people gathe
 red instead. For a lot of families it was the kitchen.\n\nAll thirty quest
 ions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFr
 om PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
