UID:puretome-question-a-day-holidays-20261126-d11-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261206
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261207
SUMMARY:What songs or music do you connect with this time of year? Where di
 d you hear them?
DESCRIPTION:Day 11 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What songs 
 or music do you connect with this time of year? Where did you hear them?\n
 \nThen: Who sang along\, and who refused to?\n\nTip: Play one of the songs
  tonight and see what it brings back.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable:
  https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No s
 ign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
