DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261207
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261208
SUMMARY:Tell me about a holiday you spent away from home. Where were you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 12 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Tell me abo
 ut a holiday you spent away from home. Where were you?\n\nThen: How did yo
 u mark the day there?\n\nTip: Holidays away are often the ones people reme
 mber best\, because they were different.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printab
 le: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. N
 o sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
