UID:puretome-question-a-day-holidays-20261126-d13-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261209
SUMMARY:Tell me about the first holiday you hosted or planned yourself. Whe
 re was it?
DESCRIPTION:Day 13 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Tell me abo
 ut the first holiday you hosted or planned yourself. Where was it?\n\nThen
 : What did you get wrong\, and what did you get right?\n\nTip: Ask how it 
 compared with the ones they grew up with. That comparison is a story in it
 self.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/
 print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe 
 from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
