DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261210
SUMMARY:Who was the person at every holiday who told the stories? What was 
 one they always told?
DESCRIPTION:Day 14 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Who was the
  person at every holiday who told the stories? What was one they always to
 ld?\n\nThen: How did they start it?\n\nTip: Ask for the story the way that
  person told it. A second-hand story is still worth keeping.\n\nAll thirty
  questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
 \n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
