DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261211
SUMMARY:What did you do on the long days off school in winter when you were
  a kid?
DESCRIPTION:Day 15 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What did yo
 u do on the long days off school in winter when you were a kid?\n\nThen: W
 ho did you spend those days with?\n\nTip: Children's games and chores tell
  you a lot about a place and a time.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: 
 https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No si
 gn-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
