DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:What is a tradition from your family that faded out? When do you re
 member it happening last?
DESCRIPTION:Day 16 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What is a t
 radition from your family that faded out? When do you remember it happenin
 g last?\n\nThen: Why do you think it ended?\n\nTip: If it is one worth bri
 nging back\, this month is a good time to try it once together.\n\nAll thi
 rty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.h
 tml\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
