DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
SUMMARY:What is a holiday you remember because it was different from all th
 e rest? What made it different?
DESCRIPTION:Day 17 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What is a h
 oliday you remember because it was different from all the rest? What made 
 it different?\n\nThen: Who was missing that year\, or who was there for th
 e first time?\n\nTip: Different years stick and ordinary years blur. Start
  with the one that stands out.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https:
 //question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\
 , nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
