DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261213
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261214
SUMMARY:What did you look forward to most in December when you were young\,
  and where did it happen?
DESCRIPTION:Day 18 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What did yo
 u look forward to most in December when you were young\, and where did it 
 happen?\n\nThen: Who made it happen?\n\nTip: Ask about the waiting. The an
 ticipation is often remembered better than the day.\n\nAll thirty question
 s\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom 
 PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html
