SUMMARY:What smell or taste means winter to you? Where does it take you?
DESCRIPTION:Day 19 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What smell 
 or taste means winter to you? Where does it take you?\n\nThen: Who was in 
 that kitchen?\n\nTip: If you can make it this week\, make it\, and ask the
  question again while it is cooking.\n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: 
 https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No si
 gn-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
