DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
SUMMARY:Tell me about the most crowded holiday you remember. Where did ever
 yone sleep?
DESCRIPTION:Day 20 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Tell me abo
 ut the most crowded holiday you remember. Where did everyone sleep?\n\nThe
 n: Who snored\, who argued and who got up first?\n\nTip: Questions about l
 ogistics get people laughing. Sleeping arrangements are a classic.\n\nAll 
 thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holiday
 s.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
