SUMMARY:What is a letter or card you got around the holidays that you remem
 ber? Who was it from?
DESCRIPTION:Day 21 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What is a l
 etter or card you got around the holidays that you remember? Who was it fr
 om?\n\nThen: What did it say\, as near as you can remember?\n\nTip: If the
 re is a box of old cards somewhere\, this is the week to open it together.
 \n\nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print
 /holidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
