SUMMARY:What did your street or town look like at night this time of year w
 hen you were growing up?
DESCRIPTION:Day 22 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: What did yo
 ur street or town look like at night this time of year when you were growi
 ng up?\n\nThen: Where did you walk\, and who walked with you?\n\nTip: Ask 
 what they could see from the window. Small details carry a whole place.\n\
 nAll thirty questions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/ho
 lidays.html\n\nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
