UID:puretome-question-a-day-holidays-20261126-d23-sub
DTSTAMP:20261116T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261218
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261219
SUMMARY:Who is someone you used to spend the holidays with who is not here 
 anymore? Tell me about one holiday with them.
DESCRIPTION:Day 23 of 30\, 30 days before the holidays.\n\nAsk: Who is some
 one you used to spend the holidays with who is not here anymore? Tell me a
 bout one holiday with them.\n\nThen: What would they be doing right now if
  they were in the room?\n\nTip: This one can bring tears\, and that is all
  right. Tears are not a reason to stop unless they say so.\n\nAll thirty q
 uestions\, printable: https://question-a-day.example/print/holidays.html\n
 \nFrom PureTome. No sign-up\, nothing to unsubscribe from.
